<p>Let=E2=80=99s approach this problem from a different angle. Imagine brea=
king into houses all along a street, and eventually reaching the last house=
, denoted as i below. How much money has been stolen up to this point?</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a diagram illustrating a coding pattern, po=
